    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Return part one is a horror and mystery game that puts you in the role of John, a man who traveled far away in search of a cure. But his recovery journey is turned upside down when he receives a mysterious message from a family member, asking him to return home. Upon his return, he finds the house plunged into darkness, the family disappeared, and an atmosphere saturated with secrets and strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will explore room after room in a house filled with family secrets. With each step, John discovers one horrific truth after another, and engages in uncovering mysterious details about what happened to the family, while a terrifying truth about his grandfather begins to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique horror experience featuring an exciting and complex story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine graphics and details enhance the dark atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intertwining puzzles that require exploration skills and concentration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious ending that paves the way for an exciting sequel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to discover the hidden truth? And can you confront the dark secrets that bind the family members?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Return part one is a horror and mystery game that puts you in the role of John, a man who traveled far away in search of a cure. But his recovery journey is turned upside down when he receives a mysterious message from a family member, asking him to return home. Upon his return, he finds the house plunged into darkness, the family disappeared, and an atmosphere saturated with secrets and strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will explore room after room in a house filled with family secrets. With each step, John discovers one horrific truth after another, and engages in uncovering mysterious details about what happened to the family, while a terrifying truth about his grandfather begins to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique horror experience featuring an exciting and complex story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine graphics and details enhance the dark atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intertwining puzzles that require exploration skills and concentration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious ending that paves the way for an exciting sequel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to discover the hidden truth? And can you confront the dark secrets that bind the family members?</p>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a dark journey filled with secrets and horror, as John returns home after receiving a mysterious letter from a family member stating that he must return home after traveling for treatment. Discover terrifying facts and uncover buried secrets in an exciting and fun experience",
